lisa-design:
gifski is built from its crates.io crate with a Rust 1.99.0 toolchain in $TMP: no Ubuntu/Debian release packages gifski and its releases have x86-64 linux binaries only. Playwright's browsers live in /opt/ms-playwright and the in-VM runtime exports PLAYWRIGHT_BROWSERS_PATH (the run's HOME and XDG_CACHE_HOME are scratch). VHS_NO_SANDBOX=1 because Ubuntu 24.04's AppArmor blocks Chromium's userns sandbox; the VM is the task sandbox.
